WEBVTT

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:17.560
He did it.

00:00:21.940 --> 00:00:25.200
So, this is the Ark of Sirius?

00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:37.080
The light...

00:00:38.130 --> 00:00:40.090
The destination is under that mountain.

00:00:44.050 --> 00:00:45.760
We need to get to the two quickly.

00:00:45.930 --> 00:00:46.760
Yes.

00:00:55.520 --> 00:00:59.980
I'd like you to listen
to your master for once.

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:08.700
Yuliy.

00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:12.450
Mikhail.

00:01:12.910 --> 00:01:17.500
You shall put an end
to the lifeline of the Sirius,

00:01:17.870 --> 00:01:21.960
and bring me the blood-soaked Ark.

00:03:24.330 --> 00:03:27.380
-Yuliy.
-So, you came?

00:03:28.130 --> 00:03:29.210
Hey, that's...

00:03:29.880 --> 00:03:34.050
Yes. I found it inside an abandoned car.

00:03:34.890 --> 00:03:37.680
It could be useful, this transceiver.

00:03:37.850 --> 00:03:40.640
-You...
-So, Yuliy.

00:03:41.310 --> 00:03:42.390
Did you get the Ark?

00:03:47.650 --> 00:03:48.480
This is it?

00:03:49.150 --> 00:03:50.740
Is that the Ark?

00:03:52.320 --> 00:03:57.330
Humans and Vampires have been
in a frenzy looking for this,

00:03:57.950 --> 00:04:01.040
and Father sacrificed his life
to seal this meaningless thing.

00:04:01.960 --> 00:04:03.040
Yuliy.

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:07.500
I'd like to hear more details,
but I'm kind of in a hurry.

00:04:08.090 --> 00:04:10.460
Right.
There's a big airship flying outside.

00:04:11.090 --> 00:04:12.300
It must be Yevgraf.

00:04:12.970 --> 00:04:15.390
He was waiting
for Yuliy to break the seal.

00:04:15.890 --> 00:04:16.850
A Vampire, huh?

00:04:17.760 --> 00:04:19.140
We need to escape.

00:04:20.270 --> 00:04:21.640
I will end this alone...

00:04:22.480 --> 00:04:24.270
as the sole survivor of the Sirius.

00:04:25.650 --> 00:04:26.480
Yuliy.

00:04:27.610 --> 00:04:28.650
Hold on, Yuliy.

00:04:30.440 --> 00:04:33.110
You can go alone and die if you want,

00:04:33.950 --> 00:04:35.990
-but leave the Ark.
-What?

00:04:37.160 --> 00:04:37.990
You...

00:04:40.700 --> 00:04:43.000
We'll soon arrive at Sakhalin.

00:04:43.580 --> 00:04:46.960
-Fly straight toward the mountains.
-Roger.

00:04:47.420 --> 00:04:49.710
After Dogville, now it's Sakhalin.

00:04:49.960 --> 00:04:52.550
How much trouble is Yuliy going
to put us through?

00:04:53.010 --> 00:04:55.590
You sure seem excited
for someone who's complaining.

00:04:56.380 --> 00:04:58.430
Well, I am excited.

00:04:58.890 --> 00:05:00.810
I mean, I finally get to cause mayhem.

00:05:01.180 --> 00:05:02.020
Whatever.

00:05:02.100 --> 00:05:05.190
-You just can't admit it, can you?
-Shut up and fly the plane.

00:05:05.520 --> 00:05:07.730
<i>Don't be reckless, Yuliy.</i>

00:05:09.400 --> 00:05:10.320
Bishop?

00:05:10.940 --> 00:05:13.070
So, you finally reveal your true identity.

00:05:13.990 --> 00:05:15.820
British Secret Intelligence Service.

00:05:16.200 --> 00:05:19.370
The Japanese Special Service Agency
is quite shrewd, too, I see.

00:05:20.370 --> 00:05:23.950
You led him here to the Sanctuary
and had him break the seal of the Ark.

00:05:24.790 --> 00:05:27.290
You contacted Captain Akasaka
for this reason, too?

00:05:27.580 --> 00:05:30.460
Yes. It was quite a detour.

00:05:31.090 --> 00:05:33.210
But if only a Sirius could break the seal,

00:05:33.300 --> 00:05:34.760
what other choice did I have?

00:05:35.220 --> 00:05:38.430
I'm surprised Britain acquired
so much information about the Ark.

00:05:39.220 --> 00:05:41.510
The Ark has caught the attention
of the world.

00:05:42.720 --> 00:05:44.890
And I got here first.

00:05:45.640 --> 00:05:48.480
-You know that's not true, Bishop.
-What?

00:05:49.190 --> 00:05:52.150
I've known that you're not a Jaeger,

00:05:52.770 --> 00:05:54.940
and certainly no longer a British spy.

00:05:55.860 --> 00:05:56.950
What do you mean?

00:05:58.610 --> 00:05:59.450
Well.

00:06:00.820 --> 00:06:02.660
So, you knew about it?

00:06:06.500 --> 00:06:07.330
Vampire?

00:06:13.300 --> 00:06:14.130
Yuliy.

00:06:15.050 --> 00:06:18.170
What made you work with me,
when you knew that I was a Vampire?

00:06:18.880 --> 00:06:19.720
Your eyes.

00:06:21.090 --> 00:06:24.220
I saw in your eyes the regret of
not being able to save your friends,

00:06:24.310 --> 00:06:27.810
and the guilt of becoming a Vampire,
and being the only one to survive.

00:06:28.480 --> 00:06:31.230
I will find the Ark before Yevgraf,

00:06:31.400 --> 00:06:34.520
make him watch me destroy it,
and then I'll kill him, too.

00:06:35.610 --> 00:06:39.820
I could clearly see in your eyes
that you weren't lying or pretending.

00:06:40.820 --> 00:06:43.030
Your eyes made me want to trust you.

00:06:44.120 --> 00:06:45.080
Trust me?

00:06:50.080 --> 00:06:50.920
Damn kid.

00:06:54.840 --> 00:06:57.760
What am I gonna do with you, huh?

00:06:59.630 --> 00:07:04.510
The faces of my dead colleagues
won't go away in my head.

00:07:05.180 --> 00:07:09.430
And because I've turned into a Vampire,
it's going to stay this way forever.

00:07:10.440 --> 00:07:13.100
Then we have that mysterious disease.

00:07:13.810 --> 00:07:16.400
The deadly disease
that could wipe out the Vampires,

00:07:16.480 --> 00:07:18.860
including myself,
was unexpected good news.

00:07:19.740 --> 00:07:24.570
But then we find out
that the Ark of Sirius could change that.

00:07:24.660 --> 00:07:27.120
How could I allow such a thing
to go into the hands of Vampires?

00:07:27.580 --> 00:07:29.660
You think you're going to end this alone?

00:07:29.750 --> 00:07:31.580
This is no longer just your problem.

00:07:32.330 --> 00:07:35.210
These guys and I all got involved
in this a long time ago.

00:07:37.210 --> 00:07:39.300
So, stop acting so cool.

00:07:40.340 --> 00:07:42.010
Let me end this, too.

00:07:44.390 --> 00:07:45.220
Fine.

00:07:46.390 --> 00:07:47.640
I ask for your help.

00:07:48.180 --> 00:07:49.680
That's what I'm talking about.

00:07:50.020 --> 00:07:51.850
You're going to work with a Vampire?

00:07:52.770 --> 00:07:54.020
Not with a Vampire.

00:07:55.230 --> 00:07:56.060
With Bishop.

00:08:06.450 --> 00:08:08.030
I found Yuliy.

00:08:08.450 --> 00:08:10.790
Where's the cowboy guy? Is he dead?

00:08:11.290 --> 00:08:13.370
Who cares about that guy?

00:08:13.460 --> 00:08:14.540
Little brats.

00:08:15.750 --> 00:08:18.040
When in danger, protect yourself.

00:08:19.250 --> 00:08:22.550
Yuliy, look over here.
I brought Misha with me.

00:08:25.550 --> 00:08:28.350
-We can finally all play together.
-Right?

00:08:29.140 --> 00:08:29.970
Mikhail.

00:08:31.640 --> 00:08:32.480
Give me...

00:08:33.940 --> 00:08:34.770
the Ark.

00:08:36.600 --> 00:08:40.030
Give me the... Ark.

00:08:42.440 --> 00:08:45.570
-Are we going to fight to the death?
-I want to play, too.

00:08:46.360 --> 00:08:48.620
Mikhail. What happened to you?

00:08:49.700 --> 00:08:51.330
Can't you hear me?

00:08:51.410 --> 00:08:52.250
That's right.

00:08:52.910 --> 00:08:56.080
Misha got punished
for not listening to Master Yev.

00:08:56.920 --> 00:09:00.170
He'll behave like this,
until Master Yev says to behave otherwise.

00:09:00.590 --> 00:09:01.800
It's the blood pact.

00:09:02.630 --> 00:09:06.130
A Vampire can't disobey the master
he's made a pact with.

00:09:07.140 --> 00:09:10.100
He let Misha do
whatever he wanted all this time.

00:09:10.390 --> 00:09:12.850
But Misha brought this upon himself,
by acting up.

00:09:13.020 --> 00:09:14.060
Darn it.

00:09:15.520 --> 00:09:16.520
-Stop.
-That idiot.

00:09:16.730 --> 00:09:17.900
He's jumped the gun.

00:09:19.060 --> 00:09:19.900
Run.

00:09:20.400 --> 00:09:22.030
You can run. You can't get away.

00:09:39.130 --> 00:09:41.380
Oh, Yuliy got caught.

00:09:41.960 --> 00:09:44.210
Give me the Ark.

00:09:44.550 --> 00:09:47.090
Brother, wake up.

00:09:51.220 --> 00:09:54.720
Give me the Ark.

00:09:59.020 --> 00:09:59.850
What are you...?

00:10:01.860 --> 00:10:02.690
The Ark is...

00:10:05.490 --> 00:10:07.860
Wow, it's glowing.

00:10:07.950 --> 00:10:09.200
Thanks, Misha.

00:10:09.910 --> 00:10:11.740
You stay here and play with Yuliy.

00:10:12.160 --> 00:10:14.620
We'll go give this to Master Yev.

00:10:16.500 --> 00:10:17.620
Bishop?

00:10:17.710 --> 00:10:21.330
What? Why are you here?
You've already finished your job and--

00:10:27.720 --> 00:10:29.760
Yuliy. Leave the Ark to me.

00:10:30.760 --> 00:10:31.590
Bishop.

00:10:37.680 --> 00:10:38.940
I spoke to Father.

00:10:40.150 --> 00:10:41.310
I found out everything.

00:10:42.270 --> 00:10:43.520
I know what the Ark is.

00:10:44.190 --> 00:10:47.690
And I know why Father took the Ark
from Dogville.

00:10:54.450 --> 00:10:56.370
Plus I've made a promise...

00:10:56.950 --> 00:10:58.200
that I would prove it.

00:11:00.750 --> 00:11:07.300
I'm going to prove the new form
of Sirius' pride Father aimed for.

00:11:23.400 --> 00:11:25.480
We're only going to slow him down.

00:11:26.360 --> 00:11:27.190
Let's hurry.

00:11:31.990 --> 00:11:32.820
<i>Mikhail.</i>

00:11:33.570 --> 00:11:34.410
<i>Yuliy.</i>

00:11:35.450 --> 00:11:38.200
<i>If I become like him...</i>

00:11:40.040 --> 00:11:42.290
<i>I want you to kill me.</i>

00:11:43.290 --> 00:11:44.130
<i>Mikhail.</i>

00:11:47.630 --> 00:11:49.050
<i>Do I have to?</i>

00:11:50.090 --> 00:11:51.880
<i>Do I have to kill you, Brother?</i>

00:12:04.940 --> 00:12:05.770
Yuliy.

00:12:13.400 --> 00:12:14.240
Yuliy.

00:12:18.700 --> 00:12:19.830
Why did you come?

00:12:20.450 --> 00:12:22.210
You know that it's me?

00:12:22.290 --> 00:12:26.750
You, a Sirius,
were never supposed to come here.

00:12:27.290 --> 00:12:28.500
So, why did you come?

00:12:29.750 --> 00:12:30.590
Mikhail.

00:12:31.420 --> 00:12:33.510
I had to come here.

00:12:34.430 --> 00:12:38.350
I had to meet Father,
and break the seal of the Ark.

00:12:41.850 --> 00:12:45.520
Bishop. Why did you kill Larisa?
You're a Vampire, for crying out loud.

00:12:46.600 --> 00:12:48.190
I didn't become one by choice.

00:12:48.860 --> 00:12:53.070
Eternal life? A noble existence?
You can stick all that up your ass.

00:12:54.030 --> 00:12:57.740
How dare you say that,
after making the blood pact?

00:12:57.820 --> 00:13:01.200
Sucking on blood, like a damn mosquito,
is boring as hell.

00:13:01.540 --> 00:13:04.370
Even babies suck on something much better.

00:13:05.920 --> 00:13:08.250
The code of Sirius stipulates
that those who know of the Ark,

00:13:08.330 --> 00:13:10.920
and those who make an attempt for it,
shall be done away with,

00:13:11.000 --> 00:13:12.340
along with their memories.

00:13:13.340 --> 00:13:14.510
Father sealed the Ark,

00:13:14.590 --> 00:13:18.470
because he thought coexisting
with another tribe was unthinkable.

00:13:19.300 --> 00:13:21.220
But that would change nothing.

00:13:22.140 --> 00:13:26.020
The Ark is the pride of the Sirius.
It is not something that should be sealed.

00:13:26.100 --> 00:13:28.980
It should remain side by side
with the pride of the tribe.

00:13:29.650 --> 00:13:31.650
That's why I'm going to face this world.

00:13:32.230 --> 00:13:33.570
I swore that I would.

00:13:35.820 --> 00:13:36.650
No.

00:13:37.240 --> 00:13:39.160
That cannot happen.

00:13:40.370 --> 00:13:43.580
Why not?
That's what living with the Ark means.

00:13:44.330 --> 00:13:45.790
I promised Father.

00:13:45.870 --> 00:13:47.330
I made a promise, too.

00:13:47.670 --> 00:13:49.670
That I would protect you no matter what.

00:13:50.710 --> 00:13:54.260
I don't give a damn about the Sirius,
or the Ark.

00:13:55.130 --> 00:13:56.630
You don't have to do anything.

00:13:57.090 --> 00:14:02.140
I'm responsible for everything.
I was supposed to do it, not you.

00:14:03.010 --> 00:14:03.850
Mikhail.

00:14:04.310 --> 00:14:05.980
I'm your older brother.

00:14:06.770 --> 00:14:09.190
Becoming a Vampire doesn't change that.

00:14:10.310 --> 00:14:12.440
I was worried about you this whole time.

00:14:13.440 --> 00:14:14.980
For the past decade.

00:14:15.530 --> 00:14:16.360
And I am...

00:14:17.110 --> 00:14:19.660
I am your younger brother.

00:14:20.450 --> 00:14:22.280
I love you Mikhail.

00:14:23.660 --> 00:14:24.620
Yuliy.

00:14:25.160 --> 00:14:31.460
How could I not do anything,
and watch you suffer so much?

00:14:33.040 --> 00:14:34.050
Yuliy.

00:14:38.010 --> 00:14:38.840
Mikhail.

00:14:46.640 --> 00:14:47.770
Why you little...

00:14:47.850 --> 00:14:49.310
Don't give me that look.

00:14:50.190 --> 00:14:52.560
I'll let you rejoin your partner soon.

00:14:54.480 --> 00:14:58.320
I'd love to destroy this right now,
but that would make him upset.

00:14:58.740 --> 00:15:00.360
It's beautiful.

00:15:01.950 --> 00:15:05.660
Judging by that glow,
looks like you gave the Ark Sirius blood,

00:15:05.740 --> 00:15:07.870
just as is instructed in the old document.

00:15:09.710 --> 00:15:12.250
Don't handle it carelessly.

00:15:12.830 --> 00:15:17.840
It's not something you could repay
with your worthless life.

00:15:19.220 --> 00:15:21.260
Yuliy. Let go of me.

00:15:22.220 --> 00:15:23.300
Don't worry about me.

00:15:24.300 --> 00:15:25.140
Yuliy.

00:15:27.850 --> 00:15:30.770
I refuse.
Even if you hit me, I'm staying with you.

00:15:31.190 --> 00:15:33.020
I see you're still stubborn as ever.

00:15:33.560 --> 00:15:37.650
But we can't be together for much longer.

00:15:38.110 --> 00:15:40.530
What? Oh, no, don't tell me that...

00:15:41.740 --> 00:15:43.660
So, you know?

00:15:44.740 --> 00:15:48.200
You know about the deadly disease
that only affects Vampires?

00:15:49.500 --> 00:15:53.960
It was the only way
to break away from the blood pact.

00:15:54.420 --> 00:15:55.250
No.

00:16:06.850 --> 00:16:07.850
Bishop.

00:16:09.680 --> 00:16:10.520
Yuliy.

00:16:11.270 --> 00:16:13.980
So, you're the younger brother of Mikhail?

00:16:14.560 --> 00:16:18.270
I thank you
for breaking the seal of the Ark.

00:16:18.940 --> 00:16:20.360
Excellent work.

00:16:21.440 --> 00:16:26.160
I thought you were
quietly waiting up there, Yevgraf?

00:16:27.120 --> 00:16:27.990
It's him?

00:16:28.620 --> 00:16:31.620
Well, you were taking so much time.

00:16:32.080 --> 00:16:35.000
I hadn't felt the sensation
of losing my patience

00:16:35.080 --> 00:16:36.380
for a very long time.

00:16:37.000 --> 00:16:39.050
Sorry, Yuliy.

00:16:40.000 --> 00:16:42.760
I couldn't be of any help.

00:16:44.300 --> 00:16:47.470
But when you decided to trust me,

00:16:48.140 --> 00:16:52.430
and told me that you would work with me,
not as a Vampire, but as me, Bishop,

00:16:53.180 --> 00:16:54.730
I was so happy.

00:16:55.600 --> 00:16:56.520
Bishop.

00:16:57.810 --> 00:16:59.020
I'm counting on you.

00:17:00.110 --> 00:17:03.190
Get Yevgraf for me.

00:17:17.750 --> 00:17:19.130
What a foolish man.

00:17:20.040 --> 00:17:24.130
Although accepted by the pact of blood,
he refused the acceptance.

00:17:25.010 --> 00:17:28.050
Mikhail,
it looks like you've done the same.

00:17:28.590 --> 00:17:31.010
You sucked the blood
of an infected Vampire.

00:17:31.470 --> 00:17:35.480
Yes. Thanks to that,
now I can finally kill you.

00:17:36.560 --> 00:17:40.020
I'm impressed to hear that coming
from a body that's practically dead.

00:17:40.360 --> 00:17:43.570
And you're doing all this
for your dear little brother, it seems.

00:17:44.400 --> 00:17:48.490
But I can only play with you
after releasing the Ark.

00:17:49.200 --> 00:17:52.700
The Ark will wake from its long slumber,
and shall be opened.

00:17:53.410 --> 00:17:57.790
The wisdom of the Sirius will manifest
for the first time in 5,000 years.

00:17:58.750 --> 00:18:01.670
I'm truly satisfied.

00:18:01.750 --> 00:18:06.260
This shall repose the souls
of the wolves lost in Dogville.

00:18:06.840 --> 00:18:08.800
Yuliy Jirov.

00:18:08.880 --> 00:18:11.510
I cannot thank you enough.

00:18:11.970 --> 00:18:14.350
Once I acquire the wisdom of the Ark,

00:18:14.430 --> 00:18:17.640
I shall allow you
to be by my side as a pet dog.

00:18:18.060 --> 00:18:20.650
You're the last Sirius dog.

00:18:20.730 --> 00:18:23.440
-I shall take good care of you.
-Bastard.

00:18:26.740 --> 00:18:29.490
In the end,
you're nothing more than a filthy wolf.

00:18:29.740 --> 00:18:33.080
Dying as you crawl on the ground
seems appropriate for you.

00:18:33.160 --> 00:18:35.830
-Yevgraf.
-But that would be good.

00:18:36.250 --> 00:18:39.330
It would truly be an appropriate way
for a Sirius to go.

00:18:45.920 --> 00:18:46.760
Yuliy.

00:18:47.470 --> 00:18:49.680
Take care of these monsters
with these two.

00:18:50.130 --> 00:18:51.510
I'm going after Yevgraf.

00:18:52.350 --> 00:18:55.600
I stole the Ark from you
in the first place.

00:18:56.270 --> 00:18:59.060
Retrieving it is the only way
to keep my dignity as the older brother.

00:18:59.140 --> 00:19:00.900
But you can't in that condition.

00:19:00.980 --> 00:19:04.400
-I will--
-Yuliy. Please, listen to me.

00:19:04.860 --> 00:19:07.400
No, Mikhail. We must at least go together.

00:19:07.490 --> 00:19:09.900
Both of you.
This isn't the time for an argument.

00:19:10.070 --> 00:19:12.570
We must think of how
to get through this situation.

00:19:13.030 --> 00:19:15.660
I don't think that's an easy thing to do.

00:19:17.580 --> 00:19:18.410
You're right.

00:19:22.080 --> 00:19:22.920
Goodbye.

00:19:23.920 --> 00:19:25.380
Die with grace.

00:19:35.510 --> 00:19:36.350
V Shipping.

00:19:37.350 --> 00:19:38.390
It's Mr. Willard.

00:19:39.020 --> 00:19:40.980
Professor. Guys.

00:19:41.390 --> 00:19:43.400
Yuliy. Sorry, we're late.

00:19:43.480 --> 00:19:46.070
Can you please try
to fly the plane more skillfully?

00:19:46.480 --> 00:19:48.110
Let's rock 'n' roll.

00:19:48.570 --> 00:19:50.150
Now let's go for another round.

00:20:00.040 --> 00:20:00.870
Damn it.

00:20:06.790 --> 00:20:07.630
Mikhail?

00:20:09.460 --> 00:20:10.300
Mikhail.

00:20:10.840 --> 00:20:13.470
-Wait for me. I'm coming with you.
-Yuliy.

00:20:15.930 --> 00:20:17.720
I believe in you.

00:20:18.810 --> 00:20:19.640
Good luck.

00:20:20.640 --> 00:20:21.680
Thank you, Ryoko.

00:20:24.480 --> 00:20:26.110
Did he just say my name?

00:20:30.320 --> 00:20:32.190
This big guy won't move.

00:20:32.740 --> 00:20:33.990
Shake him off, Fallon.

00:20:34.070 --> 00:20:35.200
Easy for you to say.

00:20:35.660 --> 00:20:37.490
It's hard enough staying in the air.

00:20:37.660 --> 00:20:39.200
Yevgraf has the Ark.

00:20:39.290 --> 00:20:41.500
-What?
-He's in the airship now.

00:20:42.120 --> 00:20:43.120
Yuliy's on his way.

00:20:44.500 --> 00:20:45.710
Head toward the airship.

00:20:46.670 --> 00:20:48.790
If you don't mind the big bug attached
to the plane,

00:20:48.880 --> 00:20:49.880
I'll do so with pleasure.

00:20:54.840 --> 00:20:57.010
There's nothing more
we can do for them now.

00:21:18.490 --> 00:21:22.240
The Ark of Sirius has existed
since ancient times.

00:21:22.950 --> 00:21:26.540
And at last,
the time has come to open its lid.

00:21:26.870 --> 00:21:30.750
The Ark shall become my flesh,
and my flesh, the Ark.

00:21:36.880 --> 00:21:42.390
For the first time in 5,000 years,
manifest yourself.

00:21:57.030 --> 00:22:02.080
I shall become the Ark of Sirius,

00:22:02.160 --> 00:22:06.580
or rather the Ark of Vampire.

00:22:19.840 --> 00:22:23.430
The lid has been opened.

00:22:23.510 --> 00:22:25.020
EPISODE 11
CALLING IN BLOOD

00:24:03.280 --> 00:24:05.490
The Ark is not for you to possess.

00:24:06.370 --> 00:24:07.490
I've finally found it.

00:24:08.450 --> 00:24:10.950
I've found what I need to do.
I've found my path.

00:24:11.040 --> 00:24:12.080
EPISODE 12
THE ARK OF SIRIUS

00:24:21.630 --> 00:24:25.090
Subtitle translation by Kozo Komori
